      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 624,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Score and AI assess\n\nAggregates prior signals into a numerical risk score, then sends the data to a Gemini-powered LLM chain with a structured output parser for a consistent threat assessment."
